# (0.27) Music Player's Volume and Stereo bars follow every change (DESK=1; tests/mousegen.py
# makes tests/vol27.keys from this; the card's Programs menu gets "Music Player"). Before
# 0.27 a bar only ever grew: lowered, it kept its old length (the rest was not painted white
# again), whichever way the value changed. tests/volbars.py measures both bars in each
# shot (the session sets the values below; Music's window content at (120, 71)).
# Shots (s), volume / stereo (0-64):
#   1  15.0  HORIZON.MOD playing (opened in Files): 64 / 32, the defaults
#   2  17.0  - four times: 48
#   3  19.5  Play > Softer: 44
#   4  21.5  a click at a quarter of the volume bar: 15
#   5  24.5  the volume bar dragged to its left end and past it: 0
#   6  26.5  a click near the stereo bar's left end: 14
#   7  28.5  + three times: volume 12
